---
name: dev-complete
version: 2.1.0
description: Dev completion report for a dev bead (dev-task or dev-fix); the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed`. The lead reads `commit` and `rebased_onto` from it for the sanity check and the link.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - sprint
  - branch
  - commit
  - rebased_onto
  - pr_number
  - pr_url
  - deliverables_complete
  - deliverables_total
  - deliverables_md
  - validation_md
optional_variables:
  - inventory_md
  - notes_md
defaults:
  inventory_md: ""
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: dev-complete
  tags:
    - stage:dev
    - orchestration:beads
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint
    state: dev-complete
    stage: dev
    transition: complete
---
# Dev Complete

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Bead: {{ task_id }} (sprint {{ sprint }})
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Commit: `{{ commit }}`
Rebased onto: `{{ rebased_onto }}`
PR: #{{ pr_number }} ({{ pr_url }})
Deliverables: {{ deliverables_complete }}/{{ deliverables_total }}

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "sprint": {{ sprint | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "rebased_onto": {{ rebased_onto | tojson }},
  "pr_number": {{ pr_number | tojson }},
  "pr_url": {{ pr_url | tojson }},
  "deliverables": {"complete": {{ deliverables_complete }}, "total": {{ deliverables_total }} }
}
```

## Deliverables
{{ deliverables_md }}

## Validation
{{ validation_md }}
{% if inventory_md %}
## Inventory
{{ inventory_md }}
{% endif %}{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
